'''Edmonton International Airport''' is the primary air passenger and air cargo facility in [[Edmonton]].

==Airlines and destinations==
===Passenger===
Edmonton International Airport provides scheduled non-stop flights to over 50 destinations. It serves as the hub for [[Flair Airlines]].
